#ASSERT `On what day is my request that my benefit period end regarded as having been made` (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 5 1) FALSE EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 6 1
-- Q: no extension, nothing else: 52 weeks
