-- 3 weeks in jail, 2 of severance and 1 of workers' compensation: 58 weeks
#ASSERT `How long is my benefit period in weeks` 3 2 1 0 0 0 0 FALSE FALSE `the 35-week maximum` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 58
-- extended under (14) by 40 weeks, but held to 2 + 15 + 35 + 26 = 78 (pregnancy, 35-week parental, sickness)
