#ASSERT `How much must I pay on or before December 31 as a farmer` FALSE 900 450 EQUALS 300
-- (3)(a): a quarter of 800 = 200; a quarter of 400 = 100
#ASSERT `How much is each of my four instalments if I pay by reference to the premium for the year or the preceding year` TRUE 800 400 EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `How much is each of my four instalments if I pay by reference to the premium for the year or the preceding year` FALSE 800 400 EQUALS 100
-- (3)(b)(i): a quarter of 400 = 100; (ii): half of (500 - half of 400 = 300) = 150; and nothing when the difference is negative
#ASSERT `How much is each of my instalments of March 15 and June 15 if I pay by reference to the second preceding year` 400 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `How much is each of my instalments of September 15 and December 15 if I pay by reference to the two preceding years` 500 400 EQUALS 150
#ASSERT `How much is each of my instalments of September 15 and December 15 if I pay by reference to the two preceding years` 100 400 EQUALS 0
