#ASSERT `Is an instalment that would fall due after a person's death required` (YearMonthDay 2026 9 15) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 10 1)
-- Q: s 152.26(1): premium 1,000, paid 700: interest on 300; paid 1,000 or more: none
#ASSERT `On what amount do I owe interest because I paid too little by my balance-due day` 1000 700 EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `On what amount do I owe interest because I paid too little by my balance-due day` 1000 1000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `On what amount do I owe interest because I paid too little by my balance-due day` 1000 1200 EQUALS 0
