#ASSERT `For how many days do I owe interest on the unpaid premium, counting both the balance-due day and the day of payment` (YearMonthDay 2026 4 30) (YearMonthDay 2026 5 4) EQUALS 5
-- (2): an instalment of 250, 100 paid: interest on 150
#ASSERT `On what amount do I owe interest because I missed part of an instalment` 250 100 EQUALS 150
-- from 15 March to 1 April 2026: 17 days of March (15th to 31st) + 1 = 18; if (1) interest begins 20 March: 15 to 20 March = 6
-- (the 20th is then in the period of (2) as well as the period of (1); whether the text means the day to count twice is fork F26)
#ASSERT `For how many days do I owe interest on the unpaid instalment, counting both ends` 250 100 (YearMonthDay 2026 3 15) (YearMonthDay 2026 4 1) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `For how many days do I owe interest on the unpaid instalment, counting both ends` 250 100 (YearMonthDay 2026 3 15) (YearMonthDay 2026 4 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 3 20) EQUALS 6
