#ASSERT `What instalment is a farmer deemed to have owed on December 31 for the purposes of interest` 3000 2400 FALSE 0 EQUALS 1600
#ASSERT `What instalment is a farmer deemed to have owed on December 31 for the purposes of interest` 3000 2400 TRUE 1500 EQUALS 1500
#ASSERT `What instalment is a farmer deemed to have owed on December 31 for the purposes of interest` 3000 2400 TRUE 1800 EQUALS 1600
